sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Reader
  participant FE as React (SocialFeedPage)
  participant API as GET /api/submissions/feed?tab=for-you
  participant P as Recommendation Pipeline
  participant DB as MongoDB

  U->>FE: open /feed (For You)
  FE->>API: GET /feed?tab=for-you&page=1&limit=20 (Bearer JWT)
  API->>P: runRecommendationPipeline(user, page, limit, seenIds)
  P->>DB: hydrateUserContext (follows, preferred tags/categories, history)
  par candidate sourcing
    P->>DB: in-network: followed authors, ≤14 days
    P->>DB: out-of-network: all published, ≤21 days
  end
  P->>P: filters: hydrate → dedupe → age → self-post → previously-served → moderation
  P->>DB: hydrateEngagement (likes/comments/reposts counts)
  P->>P: phoenixScore → weightedScore → authorDiversityScore
  P->>P: selectTopK(page, limit)
  P->>DB: hydratePreviewComments + final moderation check
  P-->>API: ranked items + pagination
  API-->>FE: 200 feed JSON
  FE-->>U: rendered personalized feed
